#. Description of the plugin
#: wm-newsticker.php
msgid ""
"A Gutenberg block for animated news tickers with scroll, fade, slide and "
"typing animations."
msgstr ""
"Blokka ta’ Gutenberg għal strixxi tal-aħbarijiet animati b’effetti ta’ "
"skrolljar, fading, żliq u tajprajter."

